  "notes": "Combined DL, AA, and UA records for January\u2013February 2025, identified delayed completed flights using delay >15 minutes, and matched each flight to origin weather by scheduled local date and hour. There were 246 delayed flights; 76 were scheduled during bad weather under the documented rule, giving 76/246 = 30.9%."
